  "economy": {
    "canonical_prices": [],
    "price_claims": [
      {
        "text": "To refine the rank three Gu, Hei Lou Lan’s rank six strength qi Gu must muster strength qi. Hei Lou Lan calls Airsac Gu truly very special.",
        "chapters": [
          705
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-trade",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_lou_lan",
          "gu_strength_qi_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With help from the light of wisdom, Fang Yuan innovates Airsac Gu and opens the guts Gu business that forces Immortal Crane Sect to compromise.",
        "chapters": [
          739
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-trade",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan tells Dong Fang Chang Fan’s soul that Airsac Gu is his creation and that the guts Gu business is also his.",
        "chapters": [
          808
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-trade",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_dong_fang_chang_fan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the Fang Yuan stone nest he splits the refinement into over a dozen steps for hairy men, and notes that this recipe does not need one refiner working nonstop. Each Airsac Gu holds one guts Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          707
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-trade",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_stone_nest"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Airsac Gu is a one time consumable Gu paired with guts Gu and sold with it.",
        "chapters": [
          825
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-trade",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Crushing Airsac Gu also breaks the guts Gu inside, turning them into nourishment that strengthens and recovers the soul.",
        "chapters": [
          822
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-and-trade",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
